---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const navLinks = [{ href: '/', label: '← home' }, { href: '/blog', label: 'blog' }];
---

<BaseLayout title="about" description="about me" navLinks={navLinks}>
	<h1>about</h1>

	<p>Most about pages start with "I am." This one can't.</p>

	<p>
		By <a href="/blog/first-time-street-hypnosis">becoming a hypnotist</a> I
        learned the limitation of every label we put on ourselves. Instead of me labeling I will
        tell you what I did the past years
	</p>

	<p>
		I am not a <a href="https://github.com/1hachem">software engineer</a>.<br />
		I am not a full-time <a href="https://nixos.org">NixOS</a> user.<br />
		I was not a CTO at <a href="https://hyko.ai">Hyko.ai</a>.<br />
		And I am definitely not a father of a 2-year-old.
	</p>

	<p>
		I do in order to be; by being, I observe, and I learn.
	</p>
</BaseLayout>
